From 1bc8a56e934d5b83fe9c98b28cb9d5424ea171d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yuyuanxun <2972982755@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 10:04:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 20/43] feat(smap): Change cold page cycle threshold to procfs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

将 SMAP_COLD_PERIOD_THRESHOLD 从编译期宏改为全局变量
g_cold_period_threshold(默认 10),新增 /proc/smap/cold_period_threshold
可写节点,支持运行时 echo 调阈值、cat 读当前值。

- smap_page_flags.h: 宏 -> extern 变量声明
- accessed_bit.c: 变量定义 + proc show/write 回调(kstrtouint_from_user,
  范围校验 [1,1000]) + fops + smap_cold_threshold_proc_init 注册 +
  4 个使用点改读变量
- accessed_bit.h: 注册函数声明
- access_tracking.c: access_ioctl_init 后注册(失败非 fatal,阈值保持默认)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
